  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nacional de Transporte Urbano</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Transportation Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT IS ORIENTED TO PUBLIC TRANSPORTATION IN CARACAS AND OTHER MEDIUM-SIZED CITIES, IN 43 MUNICIPALITIES (WITH POPULATION GREATER THAN 100,000 HA.). STRENGTHENING THE ADMINISTRATIVE CAPACITY AND FUNCTIONALITY OF THESE MUNICIPALITIES. TO PROCURE THE SERVICES AND PERFORM THE FUNCTIONS FOR URBAN TRANSPORTATION ADEQUATELY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
